    //dlctionary
    dlp8:"Mr. Heng Chea / HENG CHEA serves as a Full-time Lecturer at the Institute of Community Development (ICD).He holds a Bachelor’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management. (Note: the original Khmer text states “Bachelor’s Degree” but includes “Master’s Degree” in parentheses; this translation follows the Khmer wording.)Mr. Heng Chea has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to enhance his skills and knowledge, including being officially appointed to the government civil service framework.He has been working at the Institute of Community Development since September 1, 2018, and has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs.",
    dlp7:"Ms. Loeurn Sina / LOEURN SINA serves as a Lecturer and Administrative Staff Member at the Institute of Community Development (ICD).She holds a Bachelor’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management. (Note: the original Khmer text states “Bachelor’s Degree” but includes “Master’s Degree” in parentheses; this translation follows the Khmer wording.)Ms. Loeurn Sina has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to enhance her skills and knowledge, including completing Pedagogical Training (Bachelor’s Degree +1).She has been working at the Institute of Community Development since October 1, 2022, and has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs.",
    dlp6:"Mr. Nhoung Samnang / NHOUNG SAMNANG serves as a Lecturer and Administrative Staff Member at the Institute of Community Development (ICD).He holds a Bachelor’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management. (Note: the original Khmer text states “Bachelor’s Degree” but includes “Master’s Degree” in parentheses; this translation follows the Khmer wording.)Mr. Nhoung Samnang has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to enhance his skills and knowledge, including completing Pedagogical Training (Bachelor’s Degree +1).He has been working at the Institute of Community Development since October 1, 2022, and has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs.",
    dlp5:"Mr. Yim Sokkhoeun / YIM SOKKHOEUN serves as a Lecturer and Administrative Staff Member at the Institute of Community Development (ICD).He holds a Bachelor’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management. (Note: the original Khmer text states “Bachelor’s Degree” but includes “Master’s Degree” in parentheses; this translation follows the Khmer wording.)Mr. Yim Sokkhoeun has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to strengthen his skills and knowledge, including successfully passing the Higher Education Teacher Qualification Examination.He has been working at the Institute of Community Development since September 1, 2018, and has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs.",
    dlp4:"Mr. Seng Sitha / SENG SITHA serves as a Lecturer and Administrative Staff Member at the Institute of Community Development (ICD).He holds a Master’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management.Mr. Seng Sitha has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to enhance his skills and knowledge, including successfully passing the Higher Education Teacher Qualification Examination.He has been working at the Institute of Community Development since November 1, 2023, and has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs.",
    dlp3:"Mrs. Hul Leak serves as the Deputy Director of the Institute of Community Development (ICD).She holds a Master’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management.Mrs. Hul Leak has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to strengthen her skills and knowledge, including completing Pedagogical Training (Bachelor’s Degree +1).She has been working at the Institute of Community Development since October 1, 2017, and has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs.",
    dlp2:"Mr. Sourn Phalla serves as the Deputy Director of the Institute of Community Development (ICD). He holds a Master’s Degree in the field of Education and Community Management.He has extensive experience in managing and developing educational and community programs. Mr. Sourn Phalla has participated in various training courses and workshops related to education and community management to enhance his skills and knowledge.He has been working at the Institute of Community Development since October 1, 2002.Mr. Sourn Phalla is committed to delivering quality services and promoting community development through education and various community activities.",
    dlp1:"We can conclude that the Institute of Community Development of Chea Sim University of Kamchaymear has successfully provided education and training to all students, enabling them to achieve excellent results. These achievements are the outcome of the dedication and continuous efforts of the management team, teachers, and staff in providing encouragement, responsibility, technical support, and professional skills, while upholding their duties, ethics, conscience, and teaching professionalism. These accomplishments were also made possible through the coordination and support of the management of Chea Sim University of Kamchaymear and the guidance of the Department of Career Orientation under the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sport. In particular, the Department of Career Orientation has served as the supervisory and coordinating body, facilitating the work of the Institute of Community Development and contributing to the achievements attained today. The management and educational staff of the Institute of Community Development remain committed to continuing their leadership and carrying out their mission in education and technical vocational training for all students, while promoting educational services throughout Cambodia. In particular, the institute aims to respond to labor market demands and develop sustainable human resources in line with the era of digital transformation and the Pentagonal Strategy of the Royal Government of Cambodia during the seventh legislative mandate of the National Assembly, under the leadership and vision of Samdech Moha Borvor Thipadei Hun Manet, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The objective is to accelerate economic and social development by adopting and utilizing digital technology as a key opportunity to drive new sources of growth, with the vision of transforming Cambodia into an upper-middle-income country by 2030 and a high-income country by 2050.",
